<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>DK Payment Gateway UI (Wireframe)</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
    }
    body {
      font-family: "Georgia", "Times New Roman", serif;
      margin: 24px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    h1, h2, h3 {
      margin: 16px 0 8px;
    }
    section {
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      padding: 12px;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }
    form label {
      display: block;
      margin: 8px 0 4px;
    }
    input {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 520px;
      padding: 6px;
    }
    button {
      margin-top: 8px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
    }
    pre {
      background: #f6f6f6;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      overflow: auto;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>DK Payment Gateway UI (Guide-Based Wireframes)</h1>
  <p>These layouts mirror the screens in <strong>guide/DK_PG_INTEGRATION_ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md</strong>.</p>

  <h2>System Architecture (Context)</h2>
  <pre>
┌─────────────────────┐         ┌─────────────────────┐         ┌─────────────────────┐
│  YOUR APPLICATION   │◄───────►│   YOUR BACKEND      │◄───────►│  DK PAYMENT         │
│  (Data Source)      │         │   (Integration)     │         │  GATEWAY API        │
└─────────────────────┘         └─────────────────────┘         └─────────────────────┘
  </pre>

  <h2>Scenario 1: Pull Payment (Other Bank → DK Bank)</h2>
  <section>
    <h3>Screen 1: Payment Initiation Form</h3>
    <pre>
Complete Your Payment
Order/Invoice Number: [Order12345]
Amount to Pay: BTN 1,500.00
Description: Purchase of Product X

Your Bank Details (Remitter)
- Select Your Bank: [Dropdown]
- Your Account Number: [__________]
- Your Account Name:   [__________]
- Your Phone Number:   [__________]

Beneficiary (Receiving)
- Receiving Account: 110158212197
- Account Name: YourCompany Pvt Ltd
- Bank: Digital Kidu Bank

[Cancel] [Proceed to Pay]
    </pre>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Screen 2: OTP Verification</h3>
    <pre>
Verify Your Payment
An OTP has been sent to your mobile number ending in **1440

OTP: [ ][ ][ ][ ][ ][ ]
Amount: BTN 1,500.00
To: YourCompany Pvt Ltd
OTP expires in: 4:59

[Resend OTP] [Confirm Payment]
    </pre>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Screen 3: Payment Result</h3>
    <pre>
Success:
Payment Successful!
Transaction ID: TXN523400081332
Amount: BTN 1,500.00
Date: 22 Aug 2025, 11:30 AM

Failure:
Payment Failed
Reason: Invalid OTP entered
Reference: TXN523400081332
    </pre>
  </section>

  <h2>Scenario 2: Intra-Bank Transfer (DK → DK)</h2>
  <section>
    <h3>Screen 1: Transfer Form</h3>
    <pre>
Bank Transfer
From Account: 100100365856 (YourCompany Pvt Ltd)
To Account Number: [__________]
[Verify Account]
Account Name: [Appears after verify]

Amount: [__________]
Purpose: [__________]

[Cancel] [Transfer]
    </pre>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Screen 2: Confirmation</h3>
    <pre>
Confirm Transfer
Amount: BTN 1,000.00
From: YourCompany Pvt Ltd (100100365856)
To: Dorji Wangchuk (100100148337)
Purpose: Refund for Order #123

[Go Back] [Confirm]
    </pre>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Screen 3: Success</h3>
    <pre>
Transfer Successful!
Transaction ID: TXN6f67d4ca-c8f9
Amount: BTN 1,000.00
Date: 27 Aug 2025, 12:00 PM

[Download Receipt] [Make Another]
    </pre>
  </section>

  <h2>Scenario 3: Payment Status Check</h2>
  <section>
    <h3>Status Check Screen</h3>
    <pre>
Check Payment Status
Transaction Reference: [__________]
Transaction Date: [DD/MM/YYYY]
[Check Status]

Status: Successfully Completed
Amount: BTN 1,500.00
Date: 18 Sep 2025, 12:32 PM
From Account: *3679
To Account: *5856
    </pre>
  </section>

  <h2>Auth & Keys</h2>
  <section>
    <h3>Fetch Access Token</h3>
    <form>
      <label>Username
        <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="PG_AVS" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Password
        <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Client ID
        <input type="text" name="client_id" placeholder="PG_AVS_123" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Client Secret
        <input type="text" name="client_secret" placeholder="" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Scopes
        <input type="text" name="scopes" value="keys:read" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Source App
        <input type="text" name="source_app" value="SRC_AVS_0201" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <button type="submit">Fetch Token</button>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Fetch RSA Private Key</h3>
    <form>
      <label>Request ID
        <input type="text" name="request_id" placeholder="unique-id" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <button type="submit">Fetch Key</button>
    </form>
  </section>

  <h2>Payment Gateway (Pull Payment)</h2>
  <section>
    <h3>Authorization (Account Inquiry + OTP)</h3>
    <form>
      <label>Transaction Datetime
        <input type="text" name="transaction_datetime" placeholder="2025-08-22T11:30:00Z" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>STAN Number
        <input type="text" name="stan_number" placeholder="020111571912" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Transaction Amount
        <input type="text" name="transaction_amount" placeholder="100.00" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Transaction Fee
        <input type="text" name="transaction_fee" placeholder="5.00" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Payment Description
        <input type="text" name="payment_desc" placeholder="Payment for Invoice #123" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Beneficiary Account Number
        <input type="text" name="account_number" placeholder="110158212197" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Beneficiary Account Name
        <input type="text" name="account_name" placeholder="John Doe" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Email ID
        <input type="text" name="email_id" placeholder="customermail@gmail.com" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Phone Number
        <input type="text" name="phone_number" placeholder="17811440" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Remitter Account Number
        <input type="text" name="remitter_account_number" placeholder="770182571" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Remitter Account Name
        <input type="text" name="remitter_account_name" placeholder="Jane Smith" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Remitter Bank ID
        <input type="text" name="remitter_bank_id" placeholder="1040" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <button type="submit">Authorize</button>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Debit Request (OTP Confirmation)</h3>
    <form>
      <label>Request ID
        <input type="text" name="request_id" placeholder="REQ_6437649i" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>BFS Txn ID
        <input type="text" name="bfs_TxnId" placeholder="523400081332" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Remitter OTP
        <input type="text" name="bfs_remitter_otp" placeholder="658792" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Order No
        <input type="text" name="bfs_orderNo" placeholder="627672-98349839" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <button type="submit">Debit</button>
    </form>
  </section>

  <h2>Intra (DK-DK) Transfers</h2>
  <section>
    <h3>Beneficiary Account Inquiry</h3>
    <form>
      <label>Request ID
        <input type="text" name="request_id" placeholder="unique-id" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Amount
        <input type="text" name="amount" placeholder="300.00" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Currency
        <input type="text" name="currency" placeholder="BTN" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Bene Bank Code
        <input type="text" name="bene_bank_code" placeholder="1060" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Bene Account Number
        <input type="text" name="bene_account_number" placeholder="100100148337" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Source Account Name
        <input type="text" name="source_account_name" placeholder="Rinzin Jamtsho" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Source Account Number
        <input type="text" name="source_account_number" placeholder="100100365856" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <button type="submit">Inquiry</button>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Initiate Transaction</h3>
    <form>
      <label>Request ID
        <input type="text" name="request_id" placeholder="unique-id" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Inquiry ID
        <input type="text" name="inquiry_id" placeholder="DKBT--ptr2aseR2Ch85QY-AufVg-776768" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Transaction Datetime
        <input type="text" name="transaction_datetime" placeholder="2025-08-27T12:00:00Z" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Source App
        <input type="text" name="source_app" placeholder="SRC_AVS_0201" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Transaction Amount
        <input type="text" name="transaction_amount" placeholder="300.00" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Currency
        <input type="text" name="currency" placeholder="BTN" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Payment Type
        <input type="text" name="payment_type" placeholder="INTRA" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Source Account Name
        <input type="text" name="source_account_name" placeholder="Rinzin Jamtsho" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Source Account Number
        <input type="text" name="source_account_number" placeholder="100100365856" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Beneficiary Name
        <input type="text" name="bene_cust_name" placeholder="Sonam" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Beneficiary Account Number
        <input type="text" name="bene_account_number" placeholder="100100148337" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Beneficiary Bank Code
        <input type="text" name="bene_bank_code" placeholder="1060" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Narration
        <input type="text" name="narration" placeholder="Test transfer" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <button type="submit">Initiate Transfer</button>
    </form>
  </section>

  <h2>Status Checks</h2>
  <section>
    <h3>Transaction Status (Same Day)</h3>
    <form>
      <label>Request ID
        <input type="text" name="request_id" placeholder="unique-id" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Transaction ID
        <input type="text" name="transaction_id" placeholder="523400081332" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Beneficiary Account Number
        <input type="text" name="bene_account_number" placeholder="100100365856" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <button type="submit">Check Status</button>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Transaction Status (Later Days)</h3>
    <form>
      <label>Request ID
        <input type="text" name="request_id" placeholder="unique-id" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Transaction ID
        <input type="text" name="transaction_id" placeholder="523400081332" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Transaction Date
        <input type="text" name="transaction_date" placeholder="2025-09-18" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Beneficiary Account Number
        <input type="text" name="bene_account_number" placeholder="100100365856" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <button type="submit">Check Status</button>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Intra Transaction Status</h3>
    <form>
      <label>Request ID
        <input type="text" name="request_id" placeholder="unique-id" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Reference No
        <input type="text" name="reference_no" placeholder="523400081332" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Transaction Date
        <input type="text" name="transaction_date" placeholder="2025-09-18" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <label>Beneficiary Account Number
        <input type="text" name="bene_account_number" placeholder="100100365856" />
      </label>
      <br />
      <button type="submit">Check Intra Status</button>
    </form>
  </section>

  <h2>Results</h2>
  <section>
    <p>Response output area (raw JSON):</p>
    <pre>{ }</pre>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
